## Verdict

| Verdict | When |
|---|---|
| `{{accepted_word}}` | Every AC `PASS`, all P1 cases `PASS`, no open BLOCKER/HIGH defect |
| `{{changes_word}}` | Any blocking defect |
| `{{blocked_word}}` | Required evidence could not be produced (environment, tool, data) |

## Honesty rules

- `NOT_RUN` and `BLOCKED` are never counted as passed; show the denominator.
- An AC passes only when all its cases pass.
- Limitations (stubs, not-run cases, uncovered roles/environments, flaky cases) are listed at the top.
- Expected results are never edited in the report; deviations are listed.
- No secrets, tokens or personal data in any evidence.

